+
     ``kind`` (one of :data:`VALID_BLOCK_KINDS`, or ``None`` for a legacy
     un-typed block) drives routing instead of every block landing in one
     undifferentiated ``blocked`` bucket:
@@ -6285,11 +6354,26 @@ def block_task(
     recurrences = 0
